    staffFraming: 'A staff-level answer generalizes the principle beyond diversity specifically: any product-tunable, context-dependent business constraint (diversity, business-rule boosting, freshness/recency weighting, fairness/exposure constraints) is usually better implemented as a controllable re-ranking layer on top of a relevance-focused core model than baked into the training objective, precisely because it lets product and ML teams adjust behavior independently and quickly, without the risk and latency of a full retrain every time the desired tradeoff shifts.',
