    antiPattern: 'Blending raw, uncalibrated head outputs directly with hand-picked weights and validating the result on a same-week A/B test. Uncalibrated scores make the weights meaningless (a head with a naturally larger output range silently dominates), and short-horizon experiments cannot detect the slow retention erosion that comes from over-weighting short-term engagement or revenue.',
